{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"3":"The Book Of The Prayer For Rain (Kitab al-Istisqa')"},"section_detail":{"3":{"hadithnumber_first":1161,"hadithnumber_last":1197,"arabicnumber_first":1161,"arabicnumber_last":1197,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1192,"arabicnumber":1192,"text":"حدثنا زهير بن حرب، حدثنا معاوية بن عمرو، حدثنا زايدة، عن هشام، عن فاطمة، عن اسماء، قالت كان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يامر بالعتاقة في صلاة الكسوف","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (2519)"}],"reference":{"book":3,"hadith":32}}]}